        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2024, we acquired Teekay Corporation's Australian operations, which provide marine services to the Australian government, energy companies and other third parties.",
        "start_character": 1796,
        "end_character": 1971
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In July 2015, we acquired our ship-to-ship (or STS) transfer business, which provides full service lightering and lightering support, from a company jointly-owned by Teekay Corporation and a Norway-based marine transportation company, I.M.",
        "start_character": 896,
        "end_character": 1135
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our core business, we also provide operational and maintenance marine services as part of our Australian operations and STS support services, along with our in-house tanker commercial management and technical management operations.",
        "start_character": 4746,
        "end_character": 4992
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we acquired all of Teekay Corporation's management services companies not previously owned by us.",
        "start_character": 1972,
        "end_character": 2082
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide technical and crewing management services for two patrol boats, as well as bareboat chartering-in a bunker tanker which we have time chartered-out to a third party at a rate that is equal to the bareboat cost plus an operational element.",
        "start_character": 29793,
        "end_character": 30054
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our primary business is to own and operate crude oil and product tankers, and we employ a chartering strategy that seeks to capture upside opportunities in the tanker spot market while using fixed-rate time charters to reduce downside risks.",
        "start_character": 4388,
        "end_character": 4629
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are one of the two providers in this group that provides a complete full service STS offering, which includes the availability of Aframax tonnage to provide shipment between shore and offshore.",
        "start_character": 21342,
        "end_character": 21538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001419945-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001419945-26-000007-f06bc182a70ffca9",
        "accession_number": "0001419945-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We, through our subsidiaries, provide technical management services for our owned vessels.",
